{
  "note": "Differential vectors for offer_expiry/1.1.0 (the Go port of capsule-engine #202, d3066f5). This sidecar is not part of the vectors.",
  "engine_commit": "0c93a58fccb6d39797d55ec7174aae16d24f0923",
  "sources": {
    "replay/, live/, expected.json": "The records capsule-engine's own tests/test_offer_expiry_no_proposal.py builds (its _message, _typed_offer and _bound helpers, imported at 0c93a58 from a git archive), in each case that test covers plus nine more (two source refs, a message in another deal, a sale sealed no_proposal, a message with no sent_at whose noted at is malformed in five ways, year 0 included, and a year-0 sent_at). replay/<case>.json is a bundle of those records ({records, disclosures}, a withheld record undisclosed, an unbound one with a zeroed agent_input_digest), decided by the engine's replay(..., wickets=(offer_expiry/1.1.0,)): the offer's action.proposal_at and no_proposal and its offer_expiry constraint. live/<case>.json is an external-check-input/v0 whose record is the offer (with proposal_at beside it when the case gives one), decided by action_for_check_input and check_offer_expiry under the 1.1.0 definition (the one packs/seller-0.1.5 vendors)."
  },
